Lev 5:1 , He that sins in concealing his knowledge;
Lev 5:2 , in touching an unclean thing;
Lev 5:4 , or in making an oath;
Lev 5:6 , His trespass offering, of the flock;
Lev 5:7 , of fowls;
Lev 5:11 , or of flour;
Lev 5:14 , The trespass offering in sacrilege;
Lev 5:17 , and in sins of ignorance.
